# UI Component Library Conventions

## Tech Stack

| Concern | Technology |
|---------|-----------|
| Component primitives | [Base UI (MUI)](https://mui.com/base-ui/) — unstyled headless components, we style everything |
| Styling | CSS Modules (`.module.css`) — no Tailwind, no shadcn/ui, no CSS-in-JS, no inline styles |
| Icons | [Phosphor Icons](https://phosphoricons.com/) (`@phosphor-icons/react`) — import directly, no wrapper |
| Theming | CSS custom properties in `global.css` — components reference variables exclusively |
| Typography | `<Typography>` atom — all visible text goes through this component, supports `as` prop |
| Forms | [Tanstack Form](https://tanstack.com/form) + [Zod](https://zod.dev/) — Zod schemas for validation |
| Drag & Drop | [dnd-kit](https://dndkit.com/) — use where drag interaction is needed |
| State management | [Zustand](https://zustand-demo.pmnd.rs/) — for shared/global state only |
| i18n | `react-i18next` — all user-facing text in `en.json`, including `aria-label` attributes |
| Types | `@stridetime/types` — all domain types, enums, inputs. Never redefine them. |
| Testing | Vitest — unit/component tests per component |
| Stories | Storybook 10+ — atoms, molecules, organisms get stories. Pages do not. |
| Font | Inter (body) + Fira Code (mono) |

---

## Atomic Design — Folder Structure

```
src/
├── components/
│   ├── atoms/          # Button, Typography, Input, Badge, Skeleton, etc.
│   │   └── index.ts    # Barrel export
│   ├── molecules/      # FormField, SearchBar, StatCard, Toast, etc.
│   │   └── index.ts
│   ├── organisms/      # TaskCard, HabitCard, Sidebar, FocusTimerPanel, etc.
│   │   └── index.ts
│   ├── templates/      # AppShell, SettingsLayout, TrayLayout
│   │   └── index.ts
│   ├── pages/          # TodayPage, ProjectsPage, SettingsPage, etc.
│   │   └── index.ts
│   └── index.ts        # Master barrel export
├── utils/              # Pure utility functions, extracted logic
│   ├── formatting.ts
│   ├── validation.ts
│   ├── index.ts
│   └── index.test.ts
├── stores/             # Zustand stores
│   ├── useThemeStore.ts
│   └── index.ts
├── styles/
│   └── global.css      # ALL CSS custom properties
├── i18n/
│   └── en.json         # ALL user-facing strings
└── index.ts            # Package barrel export
```

### Per-Component Folder (STRICT)

```
ComponentName/
├── ComponentName.tsx           # Component (DUMB — minimal logic)
├── ComponentName.module.css    # Styles (references global.css variables only)
├── ComponentName.test.tsx      # Tests
└── ComponentName.stories.tsx   # Stories (atoms/molecules/organisms only)
```

### Barrel Exports

Use `index.ts` barrel exports at each atomic level:
```typescript
// src/components/atoms/index.ts
export { Button } from './Button/Button';
export { Typography } from './Typography/Typography';
```

### TypeScript Path Aliases

```json
{
  "@atoms/*": ["./src/components/atoms/*"],
  "@molecules/*": ["./src/components/molecules/*"],
  "@organisms/*": ["./src/components/organisms/*"],
  "@utils/*": ["./src/utils/*"],
  "@stores/*": ["./src/stores/*"],
  "@styles/*": ["./src/styles/*"]
}
```

