## i18n — Zero Hardcoded Strings

ALL user-facing text in `en.json` via `useTranslation()`. Including `aria-label`.

```typescript
const { t } = useTranslation('habits');

<div aria-label={t('habitCard.ariaLabel', { name: props.name })}>
  <Typography variant="body-sm" color="muted">
    {t('habitCard.streakLabel', { count: props.streak })}
  </Typography>
</div>
```

