## Forms — Tanstack Form + Zod

```typescript
import { useForm } from '@tanstack/react-form';
import { zodValidator } from '@tanstack/zod-form-adapter';
import { createHabitSchema } from '@utils/validation';
import type { CreateHabitInput } from '@stridetime/types';
```

- Zod schemas derive from stride-types
- `FormField` molecule handles Label + Input + Error display
- Form atoms integrate with Tanstack Form's field API

